cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite the prepared evidence release; external expert review and global priority remain unconfirmed."
type: software
title: "HC615: an auditable complete Czech reconstruction of a 220-symbol archival cryptogram"
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
  - name: "HC615 project contributors"
abstract: "One fixed 22-glyph substitution accounts for all 220 observed symbols, 32 source segments and 8 lines. Prepared release includes plaintext, key, source coordinates, exact symbolic certificate, controls, pinned statistical model and verification code. Individual public authorship metadata is pending; the contributor label is a project label, not an institution."
license:
